| 14            | 886        |

Vessel types (products.csv):

| j  | ProductName      | Value_j | Weight_j |
|----|------------------|---------|----------|
| 1  | Speedboat        | 29664   | 18       |
| 2  | Fishing Boat     | 31778   | 36       |
| 3  | Catamaran        | 73501   | 25       |
| 4  | Yacht            | 78255   | 16       |
| 5  | Sailboat         | 93606   | 97       |
| 6  | Kayak            | 46983   | 35       |
| 7  | Canoe            | 95026   | 32       |
| 8  | Houseboat        | 57685   | 100      |
